msgctxt "120"
msgid ""
"(A little northeast of Flawless, was it? I'm pretty sure that Golden Agu "
"company should be on the second floor...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid "(Maybe I'll deal with this pork problem another time.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"(The Public Market locals are pretty riled up about this\r\n"
"place... Maybe I'll head in and have a little chat.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid ""
"Excuse me. I wanted to ask you some things about the Golden Agu you've been "
"selling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"Who let you in here? And what the hell is this \"Golden Agu\"\r\n"
"you speak of? I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Oh! Boss, new guy, great timing! I just received word that the "
"utility-grade pork shipments arrived from both China and Australia without "
"a hitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"So! What should we label our mystery meat this time? I know we've been "
"calling it Golden Agu, but how about bumping it up to platinum status!? "
"Ooh, that oughta go over well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"You... absolute... fuckwit! Do you not know how to close your mouth when "
"outsiders are around!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"Come on, boss, isn't this the new guy? I mean, he sure doesn't look like "
"he's on the up and up about our little operation, but I'm sure we can fill "
"him in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"You know what... I'm outta here! If you have any special inquiries, talk to "
"my assistant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"You're not going anywhere until I get the truth! Now come clean about the "
"pork, or prepare to get pork-chopped!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Pay the Golden Agu Company a Visit"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Come Back Some Other Time"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2824"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2828"
msgid "President"
msgstr ""

